### Orvexa API v1 — journey step 13: analytics
### Facts aggregation over a bounded window (max 30 days — wider → 422).
### PostgreSQL facts sink by default; ClickHouse when ORVEXA_CLICKHOUSE_URL
### is set (see docs/devstack.md § ClickHouse).

@ORVEXA_URL = {{$processEnv ORVEXA_URL}}
@ORVEXA_KEY = {{$processEnv ORVEXA_KEY}}

### Summary → 200 {total_interactions, interactions_by_channel, …}
# @name analyticsSummary
GET {{ORVEXA_URL}}/api/v1/analytics/summary
X-API-Key: {{ORVEXA_KEY}}

###

### (Variant) bounded window:
# GET {{ORVEXA_URL}}/api/v1/analytics/summary?from=2026-09-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-09-10T00:00:00Z
# X-API-Key: {{ORVEXA_KEY}}
